                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 5.4,
                "security-severity": "5.4"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JS-HBS-1566555",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Low severity - Information Exposure vulnerability in hbs"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2021-32822) hbs@4.2.0"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[hbs](https://www.npmjs.org/package/hbs) is an Express.js template engine plugin for Handlebars\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Information Exposure. `hbs` mixes pure template data with engine configuration options through the `Express` render API. By overwriting internal configuration options a file disclosure vulnerability may be triggered in downstream applications.\n## Remediation\nThere is no fixed version for `hbs`.\n## References\n- [PoC and Explanation](https://securitylab.github.com/advisories/GHSL-2021-020-pillarjs-hbs/)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
