              "id": "SNYK-JS-MARSDB-480405",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Critical severity - Arbitrary Code Injection vulnerability in marsdb"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "marsdb@0.6.11"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[marsdb](https://github.com/c58/marsdb) is a MarsDB is a lightweight client-side database.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Arbitrary Code Injection. In the `DocumentMatcher` class, selectors on `$where` clauses are passed to a Function constructor unsanitized. This allows attackers to run arbitrary commands in the system when the function is executed.\n## Remediation\nThere is no fixed version for `marsdb`.\n## References\n- [NPM Security Advisory](https://www.npmjs.com/advisories/1122)\n"
