            {
              "id": "SNYK-JS-MINIMATCH-15353389",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "High severity - Inefficient Algorithmic Complexity vulnerability in minimatch"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-27903) minimatch@3.1.2"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[minimatch](https://www.npmjs.com/package/minimatch) is a minimal matching utility.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Inefficient Algorithmic Complexity via the `matchOne` function. An attacker can cause significant delays in processing and stall the event loop by supplying specially crafted glob patterns containing multiple non-adjacent GLOBSTAR segments.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `minimatch` to version 3.1.3, 4.2.5, 5.1.8, 6.2.2, 7.4.8, 8.0.6, 9.0.7, 10.2.3 or higher.\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/isaacs/minimatch/commit/0bf499aa45f5059b56809cc3b75ff3eafeb8d748)\n"
