            {
              "id": "SNYK-JS-MULTER-10773732",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "High severity - Uncaught Exception vulnerability in multer"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2025-7338) multer@1.4.5-lts.2"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Uncaught Exception due to improper handling of multipart requests. An attacker can cause the application to crash by sending a specially crafted malformed multi-part upload request that triggers an unhandled exception.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `multer` to version 2.0.2 or higher.\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/expressjs/multer/commit/adfeaf669f0e7fe953eab191a762164a452d143b)\n- [OpenJS Advisories](https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html)\n- [Red Hat Bugzilla Bug](https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2381726)\n"
              },
